Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add "Export to CSV" button to the Trends insight

Downloads the currently displayed trend series as trends-YYYY-MM-DD.csv:
one column per interval label, one row per series (labelled like the
graph tooltip, including math, breakdown and property filters) and a
Total column. The total uses aggregated_value when the API returns it
(what the table view shows) and falls back to the series count. Table and
pie results, which come without per-interval data, export totals only.
The button is disabled while results are loading or empty.
